## Why This Is Asked
This assesses end-to-end CV system design on monocular input, 3D reconstruction, semantic/kinematic outputs, and on-device adaptation, under real-world constraints.

## Key Concepts
- Monocular depth/3D reconstruction
- Voxel-based 3D representation and BEV outputs
- Multi-task objectives: occupancy, semantics, motion tracking
- Self-supervision with ego-motion and photometric consistency
- Lightweight 3-shot on-device adaptation via adapters

## Code Example
